            <div xml:id="d691">

                <pb facs="0660" n="648" sameAs="frus:frus1940v01/pg648"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">762.9411/8: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Grew</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1940-09-20T12:00:00+09:00">September 20,
                            1940—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received September 20—3:30 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>867. As a result of a 3-hour conference of the Emperor yesterday with the Cabinet
                    and the highest military and naval officials, I am informed from a reputable
                    source that the Emperor gave his sanction to the conclusion of a defensive
                    alliance with Germany. Details are not yet available but I shall explore.</p>
                <p>Sent to the Department. Repeated to Shanghai.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
